# ============================================
# KAINORA KIDS - API KEYS CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
# 🚨 JANGAN PERNAH masukkan API key asli di file ini!
# 🚨 File ini hanya untuk dokumentasi/template
#
# CARA PAKAI:
# 1. Copy file ini ke .env.local
# 2. Isi API key asli dari provider
# 3. .env.local sudah di-gitignore, AMAN dari Git
# ============================================

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TIER 1: FAST & UNLIMITED (Priority Tertinggi)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. GROQ (RECOMMENDED - Fastest!)
# Daftar: https://console.groq.com
# Limit: 30 req/min
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_key_here

# 2. DEEPSEEK
# Daftar: https://platform.deepseek.com
# Limit: 60 req/min
VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your_deepseek_key_here

# 3. LEPTON
# Daftar: https://www.lepton.ai
# Limit: Unlimited
VITE_LEPTON_API_KEY=your_lepton_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TIER 2: FREE TIER (Priority Sedang)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 4. OPENROUTER
# Daftar: https://openrouter.ai
# Limit: $1/day gratis
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here

# 5. MISTRAL
# Daftar: https://console.mistral.ai
# Limit: Free tier
VITE_MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_key_here

# 6. FIREWORKS AI
# Daftar: https://fireworks.ai
# Limit: Free tier
VITE_FIREWORKS_API_KEY=your_fireworks_key_here

# 7. COHERE
# Daftar: https://cohere.com
# Limit: Free tier
VITE_COHERE_API_KEY=your_cohere_key_here

# 8. HUGGINGFACE
# Daftar: https://huggingface.co
# Limit: Rate limited
VITE_HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your_huggingface_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TIER 3: ADDITIONAL FREE TIER
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 9. PERPLEXITY
# Daftar: https://perplexity.ai
# Limit: Free
VITE_PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=your_perplexity_key_here

# 10. NOVITA AI
# Daftar: https://novita.ai
# Limit: Free tier
VITE_NOVITAAI_API_KEY=your_novita_key_here

# 11. CEREBRAS
# Daftar: https://cerebras.ai
# Limit: Free
VITE_CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your_cerebras_key_here

# 12. OLLAMA CLOUD
# Daftar: https://ollama.ai/cloud
# Limit: Free tier
VITE_OLLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=your_ollama_cloud_key_here

# 13. HYPERBOLIC
# Daftar: https://hyperbolic.ai
# Limit: Free
VITE_HYPERBOLIC_API_KEY=your_hyperbolic_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ❌ GEMINI TIDAK DIGUNAKAN LAGI
# Kita pakai 13 cloud AI lain yang lebih reliable
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🚨 SECURITY CHECKLIST 🚨
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ✅ .env.local sudah di-gitignore (TIDAK akan ter-upload ke Git)
# ✅ .env.example AMAN di-push (placeholder only)
# ✅ API key asli HANYA ada di .env.local (lokal)
#
# VERIFIKASI SECURITY:
# git check-ignore -v .env.local    # Harus return: .gitignore
# git status                          # .env.local tidak boleh muncul
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# INSTRUCTIONS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 1. Daftar API keys (cukup 2-3 aja sudah cukup!)
#    Recommended: Groq + DeepSeek + OpenRouter
#
# 2. Buat file .env.local (copy dari .env.example)
#    copy .env.example .env.local
#
# 3. Edit .env.local, paste API key asli:
#    VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxxxxx_real_key_xxxxxx
#
# 4. Restart dev server: npm run dev
#
# PRIORITY ORDER (auto-fallback):
# Groq → DeepSeek → Lepton → OpenRouter → Mistral → ... (13 providers)
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
